{"data": [{"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:21:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120250584909668474"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/AsiaLens/statu…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AsiaLens/status/2120249927603216889", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/b0e9xylMFJ"}]}, "id": "2120250584909668474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1797, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120249927603216889", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"Several US government agencies pushed for Singapore-based Megaspeed to be included on the so-called entity list of groups connected to China that allegedly posed national security risks, according to multiple people familiar with the deliberations.   But the commerce department, https://t.co/b0e9xylMFJ", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2120250584909668474"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:09:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120247402200527244"], "id": "2120247402200527244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1995, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "I am not a politics guy, but seriously enforcing chip export controls in the wake of these Nvidia shenanigans seems to hit the sweet spot of:\n\n--Punishing corruption and self-dealing\n--Being rigorous on national security\n--Improving affordability for Americans (on the margin)", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2120247402200527244"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:28:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120237210687672738"], "id": "2120237210687672738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3696, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Caixin: “Growth in traditional labor-intensive exports slowed again after several months of improvement. Clothing, textiles, luggage and toy exports all lost momentum, as did household appliances.”\n\nEven though China has among the lowest unit labor costs in the world,", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2120237210687672738"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:15:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120233813091737923"], "id": "2120233813091737923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1931, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Bad inflation now probably means worse labor market later :(", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120233813091737923"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:51:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120227984451756154"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "20707966", "start": 16, "username": "LizClaman"}, {"end": 48, "id": "56413858", "start": 36, "username": "FoxBusiness"}]}, "id": "2120227984451756154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8481, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I’ll be joining @LizClaman today on @FoxBusiness around 3pm ET in studio", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2120227984451756154"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:05:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120216249540215270"], "id": "2120216249540215270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 15800, "like_count": 184, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "Nvidia board should say they are halting all sales to Singapore, Thailand, Malaysia and distributors in the region while they investigate and improve compliance process. Get ahead of congress, if they find problems find scapegoats like legal and sales people, but protect Jensen", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2120216249540215270"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:03:14.000Z", "edit_histo